<title>CANADA: TENNIS-QUEBEC CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QUEBEC CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>QUEBEC CITY 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $164,250</p>
<p>Bell Challenge women's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium) beat 2-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 6-0</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>5-Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Tami Whitlinger-Jones (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
